"legal.privacy.body" = "Privacy Policy\n\nWrap Guide processes camera frames, device motion, and spatial information only on your iPhone to measure a gift box and display wrapping guidance. Camera frames, depth information, and AR world maps are not saved or transmitted.\n\nThe app does not create accounts, show advertising, use analytics SDKs, track you, or collect personal data. Your active wrapping session stores only box dimensions, paper dimensions, the selected plan, and your current step on this device. You can remove it by starting another session or deleting the app.\n\nCamera access is optional. If you decline it, you can enter dimensions manually and follow diagram-based guidance.\n\nLast updated: August 12, 2026.";
"legal.support.body" = "Wrap Guide Support\n\nFor best results, use a rectangular box on a well-lit, uncluttered table. Keep all box edges visible while scanning. If scanning cannot find a stable result, choose manual dimensions; paper recommendations and every wrapping step remain available.\n\nBefore App Store release, replace this text with the developer’s public support email, legal address, and HTTPS support URL.";
